      "text": "Syria’s Foreign Ministry condemned a Houthi drone attack on a power distribution station in Medina, Saudi Arabia, stating the strike targeted civilian infrastructure. According to the North Press Agency, the ministry issued the condemnation on Friday. The ministry stated that the attack on the station, which supplies electricity to the Prophet’s Mosque, violated Saudi Arabia’s sovereignty and threatened regional stability."
